      "period": "Late Tang",
      "english_name": "Wei Zhuang",
      "wikidata_id": "Q1291502"
    },
    "title": "勉兒子",
    "poem": [
      "養爾逢多難，常憂學已遲。",
      "辟疆為上相，何必待從師。"
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "QTS_700_006_01",
    "volume": 700,
    "author": {
