      "recorded": "韋莊",
      "gender": "male",
      "period": "Late Tang",
      "english_name": "Wei Zhuang",
      "wikidata_id": "Q1291502"
    },
    "title": "憫耕者",
    "poem": [
      "何代何王不戰爭，盡從離亂見清平。",
      "如今暴骨多於土，猶點鄉兵作戍兵。"
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "QTS_700_009_01",
    "volume": 700,
    "author": {
      "canonical": "韋莊",
      "recorded": "韋莊",
      "gender": "male",
      "period": "Late Tang",
      "english_name": "Wei Zhuang",
      "wikidata_id": "Q1291502"
    },
    "title": "壺關道中作",
    "poem": [
      "處處兵戈路不通，卻從山北去江東。",
      "黃昏欲到壺關寨，疋馬寒嘶野草中。"
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "QTS_700_010_01",
    "volume": 700,
    "author": {
      "canonical": "韋莊",
      "recorded": "韋莊",
      "gender": "male",
      "period": "Late Tang",
      "english_name": "Wei Zhuang",
      "wikidata_id": "Q1291502"
    },
    "title": "題酒家",
    "poem": [
      "酒綠花紅客愛詩，落花春岸酒家旗。",
      "尋思避世為逋客，不醉長醒也是癡。"
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "QTS_700_011_01",
    "volume": 700,
    "author": {
      "canonical": "韋莊",
      "recorded": "韋莊",
      "gender": "male",
      "period": "Late Tang",
      "english_name": "Wei Zhuang",
      "wikidata_id": "Q1291502"
    },
    "title": "寄舍弟",
    "poem": [
      "每吟富貴他人合，不覺汍瀾又濕衣。",
      "萬里日邊鄉樹遠，何年何路得同歸？"
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "QTS_700_012_01",
    "volume": 700,
    "author": {
      "canonical": "韋莊",
      "recorded": "韋莊",
      "gender": "male",
      "period": "Late Tang",
      "english_name": "Wei Zhuang",
      "wikidata_id": "Q1291502"
    },
    "title": "僕者楊金",
    "poem": [
      "半年辛苦葺荒居，不獨單寒腹亦虛。",
      "努力且為田舍客，他年為爾覓金魚。"
    ]
  },
  {
