      "english_name": "Wei Zhuang",
      "wikidata_id": "Q1291502"
    },
    "title": "贈姬人",
    "poem": [
      "莫恨紅裙破，休嫌白屋低。",
      "請看京與洛，誰在舊香閨。"
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "QTS_700_015_01",
    "volume": 700,
    "author": {
