      "recorded": "韋莊",
      "gender": "male",
      "period": "Late Tang",
      "english_name": "Wei Zhuang",
      "wikidata_id": "Q1291502"
    },
    "title": "洪州送僧遊福建",
    "poem": [
      "八月風波似鼓鼙，可堪波上各東西。",
      "殷勤早作歸來計，莫戀猿聲住建溪。"
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "QTS_700_030_01",
    "volume": 700,
    "author": {
      "canonical": "韋莊",
      "recorded": "韋莊",
      "gender": "male",
