      "english_name": "Wei Zhuang",
      "wikidata_id": "Q1291502"
    },
    "title": "南鄰公子",
    "poem": [
      "南鄰公子夜歸聲，數炬銀燈隔竹明。",
      "醉憑馬鬃扶不起，更邀紅袖出門迎。"
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "QTS_700_032_01",
    "volume": 700,
    "author": {
      "canonical": "韋莊",
      "recorded": "韋莊",
      "gender": "male",
      "period": "Late Tang",
      "english_name": "Wei Zhuang",
      "wikidata_id": "Q1291502"
    },
    "title": "憶小女銀娘",
    "poem": [
      "睦州江上水門西，蕩槳揚帆各解攜。",
      "今日天涯夜深坐，斷腸偏憶阿銀犁。"
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "QTS_700_033_01",
    "volume": 700,
    "author": {
      "canonical": "韋莊",
      "recorded": "韋莊",
      "gender": "male",
      "period": "Late Tang",
      "english_name": "Wei Zhuang",
      "wikidata_id": "Q1291502"
    },
    "title": "女僕阿汪",
    "poem": [
      "念爾辛勤歲已深，亂離相失又相尋。",
      "他年待我門如市，報爾千金與萬金。"
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "QTS_700_034_01",
    "volume": 700,
    "author": {
      "canonical": "韋莊",
      "recorded": "韋莊",
      "gender": "male",
      "period": "Late Tang",
      "english_name": "Wei Zhuang",
      "wikidata_id": "Q1291502"
    },
    "title": "河清縣河亭",
    "poem": [
      "由來多感莫憑高，竟日衷腸似有刀。",
      "人事任成陵與谷，大河東去自滔滔。"
    ]
